// Confinement: the same 0.5 kg in soft rock breaks more the tighter it is packed. Tamped into a 0.5 m pocket
// it breaks about 100 tiles (a tunnel: about 80, see blast_soft_rock_tunnel); at the edge of a big cave the
// gas spreads out and it breaks about 30 (blast_cave_soaks).
